  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "Fewer Tokens, Smaller Cache: Reward-Coordinated Efficient Reasoning\nVLANeXt and CoWorld-VLA provide a unified framework for building strong VLA models, while Latent-CoT-Drive explores inference-based reasoning in autonomous driving. These studies address challenges in planning and reasoning through the integration of multiple expert reasoning mechanisms.\nSBCO (Self-supervised Block Coordinate Optimizer) improves planning agents by leveraging self-supervised learning, while addressing the limitations of self-referential self-improvement methods. This work provides a new approach for self-modifying agents with a fixed meta-agent and avoids requiring explicit self-modification.",
